You might try running (in the nethack and nh/bones and nh/save directories)
c> touch *.*
if you have it. That may cure it for once and for all, or you may have to
run it each time you want to reload.
The build date returned from the 'v' command in the game might also shed
some light. Since games from earlier versions than the one you're running
are usually invalid, you could be running into a safety precaution. I don't
know where our current sources are kept to check up on that, and I don't
want the temptation of looking for spoilers.

